codex
The pinned Lean installation itself is present, but its driver is failing before compilation. I found this is not a missing version: the exact 4.22.0 Lake binary reports the pinned commit. I’m tracing the driver’s path lookup in a read-only diagnostic so the preflight can be rerun without changing any mounted input.
